ation + Research"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools & Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Legal Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SCC Online"},{"text":"Manupatra"},{"text":"LexisNexis"},{"text":"Westlaw"},{"text":"Indian Kanoon"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Document Work"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"PDF annotation tools"},{"text":"Document management systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basics of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-discovery"},{"text":"Document review"},{"text":"Contract lifecycle management"},{"text":"Legal research AI"},{"text":"Evidence organization"},{"text":"Case-management software"}]}]},{"heading":"AI Skills for Arbitration Associates","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can help with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case-document summarization"},{"text":"Chronology creation"},{"text":"Contract comparison"},{"text":"Issue identification"},{"text":"Legal research assistance"},{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Evidence organization"},{"text":"Drafting first-pass summaries"},{"text":"Case-law discovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Large Case File","AI-Assisted Document Classification","Human Verification","Chronology","Issue Identification","Legal Research","Human Legal Analysis","Final Submission"]},{"type":"p","text":"Never rely on AI-generated authorities without independently verifying the actual statute, judgment, rule or source."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Sports-Arbitration Areas","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The sports industry is generating new dispute categories."},{"type":"h","text":"Esports"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Player contracts"},{"text":"Team disputes"},{"text":"Tournament rules"},{"text":"Sponsorship"},{"text":"IP"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Performance data"},